This repository includes, links, adapts, or references code and ideas from
several upstream projects. Their original copyright notices and license terms
remain with their respective authors.

1. ygopro-core
   Source: https://github.com/Fluorohydride/ygopro-core
   Role: native OCG duel core used to build ocgcore runtime binaries
   License: MIT License
   Copyright (c) 2015 Fluorohydride

2. Lua
   Source: https://www.lua.org/
   Role: scripting runtime used by ygopro-core
   License: MIT License
   Copyright (c) 1994-2025 Lua.org, PUC-Rio

3. IceYGO/ygosharp
   Source: https://github.com/IceYGO/ygosharp
   Role: C# YGOPro server, protocol, and architecture reference
   License: see upstream repository

4. IceYGO/windbot
   Source: https://github.com/IceYGO/windbot
   Role: original WindBot client Bot project, AI executors, Decks (.ydk), Dialogs (.json), and behavior reference
   License: MIT License
   Copyright (c) 2015-2017 IceYGO

5. MDPro3 WindBot version
   Source: https://code.moenext.com/sherry_chaos/MDPro3
   Role: source version used for the current YGOProSharp.WindBot adaptation
   License: see upstream repository

6. NLua / KeraLua
   Source: https://github.com/NLua/NLua
   Role: optional Lua 5.4 runtime binding used by YGOProSharp.Cli to execute WindBot Lua decks
   License: MIT License
   Copyright (c) NLua contributors

7. Entity Framework Core & Microsoft.Extensions (Caching.Hybrid, Caching.StackExchangeRedis, AspNetCore)
   Source: https://github.com/dotnet/efcore / https://github.com/dotnet/runtime / https://github.com/dotnet/extensions
   Role: operational database ORM (SQLite), L1/L2 hybrid caching, and ASP.NET Core web control plane
   License: MIT License
   Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors

8. Npgsql & Npgsql.EntityFrameworkCore.PostgreSQL
   Source: https://github.com/npgsql/efcore.pg
