   License: PostgreSQL License
   Copyright (c) The Npgsql Development Team

9. StackExchange.Redis
   Source: https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis
   Role: optional Redis L2 cache, Pub/Sub invalidation, atomic tickets, and sliding-window rate limiting
   License: MIT License
   Copyright (c) Stack Exchange, Inc.

10. Konscious.Security.Cryptography.Argon2
    Source: https://github.com/kmaragon/Konscious.Security.Cryptography
